findings.detail:
PlatformWebview on Windows has controller() -> ICoreWebView2Controller and environment() -> ICoreWebView2Environment (tauri mod.rs:183-197). with_webview<F: FnOnce(PlatformWebview) + Send + 'static>(&self, f) runs f on the main thread. Cargo: webview2-com = "0.39" (0.39.1 is latest), windows = "0.62" (0.62.2 is latest; tauri, wry, sysinfo and the plugins all use 0.62). Sketch:
use webview2_com::Microsoft::Web::WebView2::Win32::{ICoreWebView2_2, ICoreWebView2Settings3, ICoreWebView2Settings4, COREWEBVIEW2_COOKIE_SAME_SITE_KIND_LAX};
use windows::core::{Interface, HSTRING};
win.with_webview(move |pv| unsafe { let r = (|| -> windows::core::Result<()> {
  let wv = pv.controller().CoreWebView2()?;
  let s = wv.Settings()?; s.SetAreDefaultContextMenusEnabled(false)?; s.SetAreDevToolsEnabled(false)?;
  s.cast::<ICoreWebView2Settings3>()?.SetAreBrowserAcceleratorKeysEnabled(false)?;
  s.cast::<ICoreWebView2Settings4>()?.SetIsPasswordAutosaveEnabled(false)?;
  let mgr = wv.cast::<ICoreWebView2_2>()?.CookieManager()?;
  let c = mgr.CreateCookie(&HSTRING::from(".ROBLOSECURITY"), &HSTRING::from(val.as_str()), &HSTRING::from(".roblox.com"), &HSTRING::from("/"))?;
  c.SetIsHttpOnly(true)?; c.SetIsSecure(true)?; c.SetSameSite(COREWEBVIEW2_COOKIE_SAME_SITE_KIND_LAX)?; // Expires: leave at -1 for a session cookie
  mgr.AddOrUpdateCookie(&c)?; let mut pid = 0u32; wv.BrowserProcessId(&mut pid)?; Ok(()) })(); let _ = tx.send(r); })?;
Then call navigate("https://www.roblox.com/home"). AddOrUpdateCookie is synchronous, so the closure does not need to pump messages. Do not block on GetCookies inside the closure; use cookies_for_url from a worker thread. Signatures confirmed in webview2-com-sys-0.39.1/src/bindings.rs: CreateCookie<P0..P3: Param<PCWSTR>>(name, value, domain, path) -> Result<ICoreWebView2Cookie> (line 11414), AddOrUpdateCookie (11471), DeleteCookiesWithDomainAndPath (11509), BrowserProcessId(&self, *mut u32) (1476), SetAreDefaultContextMenusEnabled (35427), SetIsPasswordAutosaveEnabled (32323). Microsoft's sample uses CreateCookie(L"CookieName", L"CookieValue", L".bing.com", L"/").
